You and a friend can win a free African Drumming workshop with Master Drummer, Bassidi Kone on the Sunshine Coast this June 28th @ Solbar and in Byron Bay Saturday July 5th @ KulchaJam.. All you have to do is subscribe or if you are already a subscriber, get a friend to subscribe to Rhythm Culture monthly newsletters via [Contact us](/contact-us/) on the website. Please type the words 'Bassidi Kone Workshops' into the message box. Winners will be notified by email and announced on [Facebook page](https://www.facebook.com/RhythmCultureOZ?ref=hl) June 25th 12pm.
